safix: the mapping 'router' addresses 'fleet/router', and 2 items in the vault
answer to it. Nothing was read and nothing was written for it.

Nothing picks between them — not recency, not an identifier's order. A vault
legitimately holds two items with one name, and a mirror that chose would
converge a person's secret with whichever one happened to sort first.

Rename one of the items, or move it to another folder, so that the declared
address names exactly one.
